Description: Wireless Security Assessment Framework
 WSA is a tmux-based wireless security assessment conductor.
 .
 It supports manual and automated assessment flows for OPEN, WEP,
 WPA-Personal, WPA3, and WPA-Enterprise networks, with NIST SP 800-53
 remediation reporting and a teaching-grade methodology reference
 for each protocol.
 .
 Must be run as root: sudo wsa
